{
  "slug": "hunter",
  "name": "Hunter",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Find and verify professional email addresses, search contacts by domain, and enrich company data -- directly in Claude.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `build-sequences` (Builds and runs email outreach sequences end to end — create a sequence, add follow-up steps and message…), `check-usage` (Reports the Hunter account's plan, remaining credits, and usage), `company-enrichment` (Retrieves detailed company information including industry, size, location, and description from a domain name), `company-lists` (Saves companies and organizes them into Hunter company lists — save a company, add/remove companies to lists, create…), `discover` (Finds companies matching criteria (industry, size, location, technologies), estimates how many contacts exist across them, and manages saved…), `domain-search` (Finds all publicly available email addresses and contacts at a company domain), `email-finder` (Finds a professional email address from a person's name and company domain), `email-verifier` (Verifies whether an email address is deliverable by checking DNS and SMTP records), and 5 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `hunter`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hunter@claude-plugins-official` from `hunter-io/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
